{
  "slug": "hermitsh-shrimp",
  "name": "Hermitsh Shrimp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Manage your tasks from Claude. Create, organize, search, and complete tasks with natural language. Works instantly with zero setup — tasks stored locally. Optionally pair with the SHrimp iOS app for phone sync, email-to-task pipeline, and push notifications.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 command** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `hermitsh-shrimp` (This skill should be used when the user mentions \"tasks\", \"to-do\", \"todo\", \"to do list\", \"reminders\", \"things to…)\n- **Commands** (1): `shrimp-pair` (Connect to a SHrimp account)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `shrimp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hermitsh-shrimp@claude-community` from `hermitsh-ai/hermitsh-shrimp-plugin`.",
